WEBVTT

00:05:56.992 --> 00:06:00.069
to share best practices among countries.

00:06:00.069 --> 00:06:01.485
And then all the things we know a little better,

00:06:01.485 --> 00:06:02.776
the U.S. Conference of Mayors,

00:06:02.776 --> 00:06:04.812
the Mexican Conference of Mayors,

00:06:04.812 --> 00:06:08.378
the European Conference of Mayors.

00:06:08.378 --> 00:06:13.361
Mayors are where this is happening.

00:06:13.361 --> 00:06:15.890
And so the question is,

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.644
how can we create a world

00:06:17.644 --> 00:06:21.259
in which mayors and the citizens they represent

00:06:21.259 --> 00:06:23.725
play a more prominent role?

00:06:23.725 --> 00:06:26.675
Well, to understand that,

00:06:26.675 --> 00:06:30.473
we need to understand why cities are special,